# The loader (ingest), resolver (book/people/series resolution, audit, review) and
# its acquisition-date matcher were CLI tools that never lived on this branch. They
# are gone from the tree now; the tag cli-tooling-2026-07-21 holds the last version
# of all three, to be drawn on when that work is rebuilt as an upload+review feature
# on the site:
#
#     git checkout cli-tooling-2026-07-21 -- src/python/loader
#
# Nothing to ignore here any more -- that is the point.

